WEBVTT

00:10:29.792 --> 00:10:34.630
And before I leave to do that,
back to my lab that I missed very much,

00:10:35.839 --> 00:10:37.800
let me ask you again:

00:10:37.841 --> 00:10:42.554
A universe that is empty
and one with a lot of life.

00:10:42.596 --> 00:10:45.182
Which one of this
is more interesting to you?

00:10:45.224 --> 00:10:47.184
Thank you. Thank you very much.

00:10:47.184 --> 00:10:48.268
Teşekkürler.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.855
(Applause)